      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BROOKDENE (2) finished in the minors last start over the 515m at this track but ran a solid 29.77 last start. Hard to top on the time from last start. RUPEE'S ROCKET (1) comes here following a placing in decent time (25.90) over 461m at Hobart when beaten a nose in a Grade 4. This is tougher but looks a leading chance again. GOOD LUCK BABE (8) was out of the placings when fourth last time but prior to that clocked a head turning 19.35 win over 340m at Hobart. Must include on winning run two back. KISSES FOR RUBY (6) is always hard to beat when she races here at this trip.",
